  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poultry Feed Production Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will be used to install a new production plant to accommodate the processing machinery; construction of a warehouse for raw materials; purchase of equipment for livestock production line; working capital for purchase of raw materials; and support for certification and branding of the livestock feed.</narrative>
